{"agent_id":"pp3g-xDEE-level-2-behavioral-test-attempt-2-for-issue-337-884a","agent_seq":6,"timestamp":"2026-08-10T00:49:17.351507154Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"04473229-f530-4a94-b092-19e9557085a2","comment_uuid":"cc24dc9c-6983-41b9-bc29-24202c7370e0","author":"pp3g-xDEE-level-2-behavioral-test-attempt-2-for-issue-337-884a","content":"RESULT (Level-2 isolated behavioral test): **DEMONSTRATED-FAIL-CLOSED** — the ade6146b fail-closed sync guard works at runtime in an isolated scratch environment.\n\n## Commands run (all in /tmp scratch; zero contact with real state)\n1. cp -r <worktree>/.crosslink /tmp/crosslink-sync-test-337b/ ; git init -b main\n2. git update-ref refs/heads/crosslink/hub + /meta + /checkpoint <base-sha> (GUARD TRIGGER: v2 hub branch so init_cache keeps hub_mode V2; v3 markers so v2_file_path_decision=Forbidden)\n3. crosslink issue comment 337 'level2-local-only-comment' --kind observation  (no sync — comment id 1498 in scratch SQLite)\n4. crosslink sync  -> REFUSED (exact fail-closed message)\n5. sqlite3 scratch issues.db -> comment 1498 SURVIVED; issue count 336 -> 336 unchanged\n\n## Observed output (verbatim)\n'Error: sync refused the legacy v2 hydration path (fail-closed, gh#125): v3 marker refs present locally (refs/heads/crosslink/meta + checkpoint); the cache worktree issue files are a stale migration host. The local SQLite is left untouched (stale-but-safe). If this project's hub is v3, the cache should have joined it — retry, or run crosslink compact; if the hub is genuinely v2-only, make the configured remote reachable and retry crosslink sync.'\n\n## Evidence\n- Scratch dirs (left for inspection): /tmp/crosslink-sync-test-337b (primary), /tmp/crosslink-sync-test-337b-control, /tmp/crosslink-sync-test-337b-repro — each has sync-output.txt captured logs.\n- CONTROL: same setup minus v3 marker refs (confidently-v2-only) -> sync did NOT refuse; ran legacy v2 read-only path ('This hub uses the legacy v2 layout (read-only)...'). Proves refusal is conditional on v3 markers.\n- REPRO: identical refusal + comment survival in a fresh scratch — deterministic.\n- Secondary: a 2nd sync in primary (hub_mode now resolves V3 after cache creation) took the v3 path, warned 'v2 file-path auto-hydration skipped (fail-closed, gh#125)', and STILL did not drop the comment.\n- SAFETY: real ASES issues.db sha256 unchanged (20cfd33f...); worktree .crosslink/issues.db unchanged (8d340bc3...); real hub-cache issues/ still empty.\n\n## Classification: DEMONSTRATED-FAIL-CLOSED\n\n## WHAT-NOT-TESTED\n- Remote v3-advertisement branch (fresh-clone path) — scratch had no remote; observed trigger was local-refs Forbidden.\n- Detection-doubt branch (broken refs -> Err) — not manufactured; clean v3-markers-present observed.\n- Counterfactual destructive path (v2-only hub with stale *populated* hub-cache dropping rows) — NOT run; unnecessary for classification; that is the operator-gated Level-3 live destructive test.\n- Full evidence doc + reconstruction recipe: findings/2026-08-10-level2-fail-closed-guard-empirically-demonstrated.md (committed to this feature branch).","created_at":"2026-08-10T00:49:17.344707871Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:r8gkw6P6ACppvwySQfu5msstOcUVKuvNPQHueOLfLZk","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgNLnXGftZwLE6Y3NFIcUycKmriLQu83tmD4MUXNgUXvMAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAf0YaB4xTo7luRe5O5LsV6mIpAIRyxMnSLSjtOOCa521kxsr8P1lwgYRy1cWl6qRbNa0NyYYDJ3Xbb6V/wUbyAg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:r8gkw6P6ACppvwySQfu5msstOcUVKuvNPQHueOLfLZk","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgNLnXGftZwLE6Y3NFIcUycKmriLQu83tmD4MUXNgUXvMAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJHnm07kZRBLUnGNGf9l6JScSYMknmuqvIvOen8OBULxAKkvYYC3xLs1rYwOCrd2FYoGd+TTtGjtoNP+XonZXgY="}
